From udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com  Tue Oct 10 22:53:43 2017
From: udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com (Perry de Valpine)
Date: Tue, 10 Oct 2017 22:53:43 +0000
Subject: Re: Convergence problems for state-space time-series model
